1
00:01:26,505 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:43,985 --> 00:01:45,345
Most guests who come here

3
00:01:46,345 --> 00:01:47,865
either have money but no looks,

4
00:01:48,425 --> 00:01:49,385
and are unbearably vulgar,

5
00:01:50,225 --> 00:01:51,825
or have looks but no money,

6
00:01:53,145 --> 00:01:54,705
with barely a coin to their name.

7
00:01:54,785 --> 00:01:58,105
It is rare to meet a gentleman

8
00:01:58,865 --> 00:02:00,865
who has both wealth and looks.

9
00:02:01,705 --> 00:02:02,745
I don't believe that.

10
00:02:03,905 --> 00:02:06,705
I hear Lady Xiangning's admirers

11
00:02:06,785 --> 00:02:07,825
are all rich or powerful.

12
00:02:09,745 --> 00:02:13,025
Even the notorious leader
of the Tiger's Roar Gang

13
00:02:13,105 --> 00:02:14,905
is utterly bewitched by you

14
00:02:14,985 --> 00:02:16,505
and often comes to support you.

15
00:02:17,505 --> 00:02:20,985
The court has put a ten-thousand-tael
bounty on that villain.

16
00:02:21,265 --> 00:02:22,705
If I knew him,

17
00:02:22,785 --> 00:02:24,105
I'd be rich already.

18
00:02:28,905 --> 00:02:31,305
Lady Xiangning is both gifted
and beautiful.

19
00:02:32,145 --> 00:02:33,785
If he truly cared for you,

20
00:02:34,625 --> 00:02:36,625
he would never leave you
at Wanxiang House.

21
00:02:37,465 --> 00:02:38,585
Were it me,

22
00:02:39,425 --> 00:02:41,145
I would build you a golden chamber

23
00:02:41,225 --> 00:02:42,345
and keep you all to myself.

24
00:02:44,665 --> 00:02:46,105
To be honest,

25
00:02:46,185 --> 00:02:48,025
I saw the portrait on the wall.

26
00:02:48,825 --> 00:02:51,665
That gang leader is quite handsome.

27
00:02:52,305 --> 00:02:53,785
Had I ever seen him,

28
00:02:53,865 --> 00:02:54,865
I would never forget him.

29
00:02:57,265 --> 00:02:59,945
But by comparison,

30
00:03:00,425 --> 00:03:02,905
you are far more delectable.

31
00:03:02,985 --> 00:03:03,945
You truly

32
00:03:04,785 --> 00:03:06,465
delight me.

33
00:03:07,465 --> 00:03:09,785
But whether I may leave with you tonight

34
00:03:10,945 --> 00:03:12,025
still depends…

35
00:03:17,545 --> 00:03:18,505
Who is it?

36
00:03:26,305 --> 00:03:27,665
Young Master He.

37
00:03:29,585 --> 00:03:30,985
So you two gentlemen know each other.

38
00:03:35,665 --> 00:03:37,145
We agreed that tonight

39
00:03:37,225 --> 00:03:38,625
Lady Xiangning would be mine.

40
00:03:39,625 --> 00:03:41,665
Is this how Wanxiang House
does business?

41
00:03:43,665 --> 00:03:45,545
There must have been a mistake.

42
00:03:45,625 --> 00:03:48,265
But seeing such a fine gentleman,

43
00:03:48,825 --> 00:03:50,425
I find it

44
00:03:50,505 --> 00:03:51,825
hard to refuse.

45
00:03:54,305 --> 00:03:55,465
I

46
00:03:57,985 --> 00:04:00,065
will add another hundred taels.

47
00:04:00,545 --> 00:04:02,465
How generous you are,
handsome sir.

48
00:04:03,225 --> 00:04:05,425
Now I truly cannot choose.

49
00:04:06,585 --> 00:04:08,785
Aren't you arranging a marriage,
Young Master He?

50
00:04:08,865 --> 00:04:11,665
How do you have time to fight me
over a lady at Wanxiang House?

51
00:04:11,745 --> 00:04:12,745
You misunderstand, Young Master Meng.

52
00:04:13,385 --> 00:04:14,865
I have never discussed marriage.

53
00:04:14,945 --> 00:04:16,545
As for why I came here,

54
00:04:16,625 --> 00:04:18,745
surely you know it well.

55
00:04:18,825 --> 00:04:20,985
Why must you two compete?

56
00:04:21,065 --> 00:04:22,345
Why not

57
00:04:22,425 --> 00:04:23,465
share my company?

58
00:04:24,305 --> 00:04:25,505
But today,

59
00:04:25,585 --> 00:04:27,225
I am feeling rather weary.

60
00:04:27,305 --> 00:04:28,785
Does Wanxiang House

61
00:04:28,865 --> 00:04:30,665
have anything to restore one's vigor

62
00:04:30,745 --> 00:04:32,265
and heighten the pleasure?

63
00:04:35,105 --> 00:04:37,385
You are in the prime of youth,

64
00:04:37,465 --> 00:04:38,705
full of vigor.

65
00:04:38,785 --> 00:04:40,545
Why would you need such stimulants?

66
00:04:41,385 --> 00:04:45,065
You are not like those rich young men
who look good but lack stamina.

67
00:04:45,425 --> 00:04:48,025
They rely on Infinity Pills
for their pleasure.

68
00:04:48,425 --> 00:04:49,305
But you

69
00:04:49,825 --> 00:04:51,065
need no such thing.

70
00:04:53,225 --> 00:04:55,585
The name Infinity Pill

71
00:04:55,665 --> 00:04:57,225
has piqued my interest.

72
00:04:57,585 --> 00:04:59,105
Does Wanxiang House really have them?

73
00:05:01,105 --> 00:05:03,465
So the handsome gentleman is interested.

74
00:05:04,305 --> 00:05:06,385
But to tell you the truth,

75
00:05:07,025 --> 00:05:08,905
Infinity Pills are rare now,

76
00:05:08,985 --> 00:05:10,425
and no amount of money can buy them.

77
00:05:11,625 --> 00:05:13,745
Wanxiang House has none left.

78
00:05:14,985 --> 00:05:17,385
Do you think we cannot afford them?

79
00:05:18,225 --> 00:05:20,705
Today, I insist on buying a few to try.

80
00:05:21,785 --> 00:05:23,945
You are indeed exceedingly wealthy.

81
00:05:24,025 --> 00:05:26,825
But the last batch of Infinity Pills

82
00:05:26,905 --> 00:05:28,225
was used up three days ago.

83
00:05:28,305 --> 00:05:30,265
When might we get to try them?

84
00:05:31,585 --> 00:05:32,985
In another month,

85
00:05:33,065 --> 00:05:35,665
you two new patrons can wait
for the next batch.

86
00:05:36,945 --> 00:05:38,665
But the price

87
00:05:38,745 --> 00:05:40,465
will be higher.

88
00:05:41,105 --> 00:05:42,425
We have to wait that long?

89
00:05:43,825 --> 00:05:46,585
Then tell us where
the Infinity Pills come from.

90
00:05:47,425 --> 00:05:48,865
Please forgive us, honored guests.

91
00:05:49,705 --> 00:05:51,945
It is my fault
for failing to manage this place.

92
00:05:52,025 --> 00:05:53,665
My staff were careless

93
00:05:53,745 --> 00:05:55,425
and posted Xiangning's plaque twice.

94
00:05:56,105 --> 00:05:57,545
Your payment

95
00:05:57,625 --> 00:05:59,305
was meant for Nannan's performance.

96
00:05:59,385 --> 00:06:00,785
As for Xiangning,

97
00:06:00,865 --> 00:06:02,465
she already has an appointment
with a regular patron.

98
00:06:03,025 --> 00:06:05,345
I will take you both to Nannan.

99
00:06:05,905 --> 00:06:07,425
I will pay double.

100
00:06:07,505 --> 00:06:08,465
Young Master,

101
00:06:08,545 --> 00:06:11,105
Wanxiang House has failed you tonight.

102
00:06:11,185 --> 00:06:12,465
We will not take

103
00:06:12,545 --> 00:06:13,905
a single coin.

104
00:06:14,385 --> 00:06:15,985
Consider it

105
00:06:16,065 --> 00:06:17,225
our apology to you both.

106
00:06:18,545 --> 00:06:20,825
But the rules of this house
cannot be broken.

107
00:06:22,065 --> 00:06:23,065
Xiangning.

108
00:06:23,625 --> 00:06:24,745
Go to the west wing.

109
00:06:29,465 --> 00:06:30,425
Forget it.

110
00:06:30,945 --> 00:06:33,305
We are not men who force a sale.

111
00:06:34,865 --> 00:06:35,705
Young Master He,

112
00:06:36,505 --> 00:06:38,985
let us seek amusement elsewhere.

113
00:06:43,345 --> 00:06:44,185
Madam,

114
00:06:45,225 --> 00:06:47,105
if you like it here,

115
00:06:47,185 --> 00:06:48,785
next time you need not

116
00:06:48,865 --> 00:06:50,265
trouble yourself with a disguise.

117
00:06:50,945 --> 00:06:52,065
Our house

118
00:06:52,145 --> 00:06:53,065
welcomes both men and women.

119
00:06:54,465 --> 00:06:55,665
Come again,

120
00:06:55,745 --> 00:06:56,625
and I will have Xiangning

121
00:06:56,705 --> 00:06:58,265
personally apologize to you.

122
00:06:59,065 --> 00:06:59,905
Very well.

123
00:07:10,505 --> 00:07:12,145
Young Master Meng looks
truly dashing.

124
00:07:13,105 --> 00:07:14,545
It seems dressing as a man

125
00:07:14,625 --> 00:07:15,585
has become second nature to you.

126
00:07:18,025 --> 00:07:18,905
Naturally.

127
00:07:20,505 --> 00:07:22,465
Why did Your Majesty come
to Wanxiang House today?

128
00:07:23,385 --> 00:07:25,985
Di Nian and Zhishu told me
about the Infinity Pills.

129
00:07:26,665 --> 00:07:27,945
This bustling night market,

130
00:07:28,025 --> 00:07:29,145
where the people live and work in peace,

131
00:07:29,225 --> 00:07:30,705
has always been what I desire.

132
00:07:31,465 --> 00:07:33,825
But Ling Yunfei is like a specter
haunting this market,

133
00:07:34,385 --> 00:07:36,785
ready to tear apart
this prosperity at any moment.

134
00:07:37,345 --> 00:07:38,585
Judging from Xiangning's reaction,

135
00:07:38,665 --> 00:07:40,145
she does not seem to know Ling Yunfei.

136
00:07:40,745 --> 00:07:42,305
But from what she just said,

137
00:07:42,385 --> 00:07:43,825
the next batch of Infinity Pills

138
00:07:43,905 --> 00:07:45,265
will soon arrive at Wanxiang House.

139
00:07:46,105 --> 00:07:47,625
If they are tied
to the Tiger's Roar Gang,

140
00:07:47,705 --> 00:07:49,705
we can use this chance
to capture Ling Yunfei.

141
00:07:50,305 --> 00:07:51,745
If the Infinity Pills spread,

142
00:07:51,825 --> 00:07:53,745
they will throw all Daning into chaos.

143
00:07:53,825 --> 00:07:55,985
We must stop Ling Yunfei's scheme
as soon as possible.

144
00:07:56,625 --> 00:07:57,585
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

145
00:07:58,105 --> 00:07:59,345
I will do everything in my power

146
00:08:00,185 --> 00:08:01,545
to protect this age of peace.

147
00:08:04,905 --> 00:08:05,745
I believe in you.

148
00:08:07,905 --> 00:08:10,265
But danger lurks everywhere
and hidden currents are stirring.

149
00:08:10,905 --> 00:08:12,105
I will face it

150
00:08:12,905 --> 00:08:13,825
together with you.

151
00:08:18,305 --> 00:08:19,145
By the way,

152
00:08:19,745 --> 00:08:21,425
I bestowed a marriage
upon the Wen family today.

153
00:08:21,505 --> 00:08:23,665
-Congratulations, Your Majesty.
-You should congratulate the Left Chancellor.

154
00:08:24,985 --> 00:08:26,785
The Xu and Wen families
have always been close.

155
00:08:26,865 --> 00:08:29,025
The Left Chancellor's son
and the Wen family's daughter

156
00:08:29,105 --> 00:08:30,985
are well matched in status

157
00:08:31,065 --> 00:08:32,025
and make a fine pair.

158
00:08:34,865 --> 00:08:36,425
Your Majesty is truly

159
00:08:37,185 --> 00:08:38,385
wicked.

160
00:08:40,185 --> 00:08:41,505
Then tell me,

161
00:08:42,745 --> 00:08:43,785
do you like my arrangement?

162
00:08:47,465 --> 00:08:48,545
What does that have to do with me?

163
00:08:59,745 --> 00:09:02,145
Sugar candy! Delicious sugar candy!

164
00:09:02,865 --> 00:09:03,905
Come, gentlemen.

165
00:09:03,985 --> 00:09:05,825
Our sugar candy is made
from a secret recipe.

166
00:09:06,305 --> 00:09:08,105
Sweet and delicious,
with a lingering flavor.

167
00:09:08,345 --> 00:09:09,225
Have a taste.

168
00:09:11,745 --> 00:09:12,705
Why did I never see this food

169
00:09:13,305 --> 00:09:14,625
when I was in Shazhou?

170
00:09:15,305 --> 00:09:17,945
Shazhou's food is very different
from the capital's.

171
00:09:19,265 --> 00:09:20,225
Two, please.

172
00:10:34,185 --> 00:10:35,265
So sweet.

173
00:10:38,185 --> 00:10:39,025
So sweet.

174
00:10:42,185 --> 00:10:43,825
I meant the sugar candy.

175
00:10:43,905 --> 00:10:45,025
So did I.

176
00:11:01,705 --> 00:11:04,065
-Young Master He.
-Lady Situ.

177
00:11:06,505 --> 00:11:08,105
Lady Meng looks exceptionally handsome

178
00:11:08,185 --> 00:11:09,185
even dressed as a man.

179
00:11:09,265 --> 00:11:10,945
Would you two care

180
00:11:11,025 --> 00:11:13,305
to sit with me at Huiyin House tonight?

181
00:11:53,705 --> 00:11:54,585
Gladly.

182
00:11:55,945 --> 00:11:57,145
I never expected Lord Meng

183
00:11:57,225 --> 00:11:59,105
and Lady Situ to be so familiar.

184
00:11:59,665 --> 00:12:01,385
You can even perform in harmony

185
00:12:01,465 --> 00:12:02,345
a song few people know.

186
00:12:02,905 --> 00:12:03,905
I am quite surprised.

187
00:12:04,745 --> 00:12:06,905
Do you two share some past connection?

188
00:12:06,985 --> 00:12:08,145
It is strange.

189
00:12:08,865 --> 00:12:10,145
For some reason,

190
00:12:10,225 --> 00:12:12,465
this melody feels inexplicably familiar.

191
00:12:13,865 --> 00:12:15,345
It is a song passed down in my family.

192
00:12:15,425 --> 00:12:18,265
Perhaps Lady Meng heard it
on a previous visit,

193
00:12:18,825 --> 00:12:20,025
and after hearing it often,

194
00:12:20,105 --> 00:12:21,425
it naturally feels familiar.

195
00:12:21,505 --> 00:12:22,985
I visit music houses often,

196
00:12:23,065 --> 00:12:23,945
yet I have never heard this melody.

197
00:12:24,785 --> 00:12:25,785
Could it be

198
00:12:26,945 --> 00:12:29,385
that Lady Situ prepared it
especially for Lord Meng?

199
00:12:30,945 --> 00:12:32,385
Whenever you visit,

200
00:12:32,465 --> 00:12:33,905
you only ask about my past,

201
00:12:34,825 --> 00:12:36,545
full of curiosity about me.

202
00:12:36,625 --> 00:12:37,745
When have you ever

203
00:12:37,825 --> 00:12:39,385
paid attention to the music?

204
00:12:40,105 --> 00:12:41,785
Still, Young Master He is perceptive.

205
00:12:41,865 --> 00:12:44,345
This piece is called
Chant of Tranquility.

206
00:12:44,425 --> 00:12:47,025
It calms the mind
and soothes troubled thoughts.

207
00:12:47,905 --> 00:12:50,145
Today, I played it
especially for Lady Meng.

208
00:12:50,985 --> 00:12:53,065
I have always wished
to ease your troubles.

209
00:12:53,145 --> 00:12:54,985
Should you ever need my help,

210
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:56,145
please do not hesitate to ask.

211
00:12:56,225 --> 00:12:59,145
Huiyin House and Wanxiang House
are both on Changle Street.

212
00:13:00,305 --> 00:13:01,625
Lady Situ,

213
00:13:01,705 --> 00:13:03,185
do you know much
about Wanxiang House?

214
00:13:04,505 --> 00:13:05,705
The ladies of Wanxiang House

215
00:13:05,785 --> 00:13:07,945
are diligent about beauty and health,

216
00:13:08,025 --> 00:13:09,425
and often come to seek my advice.

217
00:13:09,505 --> 00:13:11,745
The person they mention most

218
00:13:11,825 --> 00:13:13,345
is their madam, Liu Ruyan.

219
00:13:14,185 --> 00:13:16,545
She was once merely
an ordinary courtesan there,

220
00:13:16,625 --> 00:13:17,785
but now she has become

221
00:13:17,865 --> 00:13:19,545
the one who runs Wanxiang House.

222
00:13:20,705 --> 00:13:23,345
Every woman there
is utterly devoted to her,

223
00:13:23,665 --> 00:13:24,785
and sincerely submits to her.

224
00:13:24,865 --> 00:13:27,545
They say she treats them
better than their own mothers.

225
00:13:27,625 --> 00:13:29,425
Her skill at winning hearts

226
00:13:29,505 --> 00:13:31,145
is truly remarkable.

227
00:13:31,225 --> 00:13:32,705
In that case,

228
00:13:33,265 --> 00:13:35,225
someone may be helping her
from behind the scenes.

229
00:13:35,905 --> 00:13:37,425
You are perceptive, Young Master He.

230
00:13:37,505 --> 00:13:40,185
I hear that person visits
Wanxiang House every month,

231
00:13:40,265 --> 00:13:41,905
yet no one has ever seen his true face.

232
00:13:41,985 --> 00:13:44,985
Very little is known about him.

233
00:13:45,065 --> 00:13:47,545
Have you ever dealt
with Madam Liu?

234
00:13:47,625 --> 00:13:49,105
We have never met.

235
00:13:49,625 --> 00:13:52,545
But she is quite fond
of our fragrant medicinal baths

236
00:13:52,625 --> 00:13:54,465
and sends someone to collect some
a few days each month.

237
00:13:55,305 --> 00:13:57,865
The bath is made
with the herb eupatorium.

238
00:13:58,425 --> 00:14:01,545
When prepared fresh,
it retains its rich fragrance

239
00:14:01,625 --> 00:14:02,905
and dispels wind and cold,

240
00:14:02,985 --> 00:14:04,065
refreshes the mind,

241
00:14:04,145 --> 00:14:05,305
and nourishes the whole body.

242
00:14:05,385 --> 00:14:08,505
Compared with an ordinary medicinal bath,

243
00:14:08,585 --> 00:14:09,745
does it have any special qualities?

244
00:14:10,865 --> 00:14:12,065
Special qualities?

245
00:14:13,025 --> 00:14:14,025
Of course.

246
00:14:23,305 --> 00:14:26,225
This secret formula
was created by a renowned physician.

247
00:14:26,305 --> 00:14:27,625
It not only balances yin and yang,

248
00:14:28,185 --> 00:14:30,185
but also heightens pleasure in bed.

249
00:14:30,265 --> 00:14:32,185
It truly offers the best of both worlds.

250
00:14:32,865 --> 00:14:34,665
It is not something
an ordinary brothel could possess.

251
00:14:34,745 --> 00:14:38,065
I do not know whether
the two are connected.

252
00:14:39,305 --> 00:14:40,145
Lady Situ,

253
00:14:40,985 --> 00:14:43,305
if Madam Liu requests this medicine again,

254
00:14:44,305 --> 00:14:45,505
could you inform me?

255
00:14:46,345 --> 00:14:47,345
Certainly.

256
00:14:48,025 --> 00:14:49,225
Thank you for telling me.

257
00:14:50,145 --> 00:14:51,185
I offer tea in place of wine

258
00:14:52,425 --> 00:14:53,385
and drink to you.

259
00:14:55,585 --> 00:14:57,625
We are like sisters.
There is no need for such formality.

260
00:15:00,745 --> 00:15:02,225
I never expected Lady Situ

261
00:15:02,305 --> 00:15:03,345
and Lord Meng

262
00:15:03,425 --> 00:15:05,585
to already address each other as sisters.

263
00:15:07,105 --> 00:15:09,025
Lady Situ has helped me many times.

264
00:15:10,065 --> 00:15:11,585
While she was treating me,

265
00:15:11,665 --> 00:15:13,905
I felt we were kindred spirits,

266
00:15:13,985 --> 00:15:15,225
so we naturally grew close.

267
00:15:15,945 --> 00:15:17,865
If Lady Situ and Lord Meng

268
00:15:17,945 --> 00:15:20,265
are truly honest with each other,

269
00:15:20,345 --> 00:15:21,545
then that is naturally a good thing.

270
00:15:21,625 --> 00:15:23,145
Your words today

271
00:15:23,225 --> 00:15:24,865
always seem to carry hidden meaning.

272
00:15:24,945 --> 00:15:26,385
You care so much about Lady Meng

273
00:15:26,465 --> 00:15:28,105
that I am growing jealous.

274
00:15:28,585 --> 00:15:29,985
When you last visited,

275
00:15:30,065 --> 00:15:31,505
you called me your confidante.

276
00:15:31,585 --> 00:15:32,465
What is this?

277
00:15:32,825 --> 00:15:34,265
Have you forgotten me so quickly?

278
00:15:34,345 --> 00:15:35,825
Lady Situ has

279
00:15:35,905 --> 00:15:37,265
so many confidants.

280
00:15:37,345 --> 00:15:39,385
When would my turn ever come?

281
00:15:39,465 --> 00:15:40,905
I was merely

282
00:15:41,585 --> 00:15:43,225
curious about your relationship.

283
00:15:43,305 --> 00:15:44,825
I regard Lady Meng
as a cherished friend.

284
00:15:45,305 --> 00:15:46,865
My feelings are entirely sincere.

285
00:15:48,345 --> 00:15:49,625
And your feelings for Lady Meng?

286
00:15:55,305 --> 00:15:56,825
They are sincere as well.

287
00:16:01,865 --> 00:16:03,625
The person Lady Situ mentioned

288
00:16:04,185 --> 00:16:05,305
must be Ling Yunfei.

289
00:16:06,065 --> 00:16:07,985
It seems Liu Ruyan
is deeply involved with him.

290
00:16:08,505 --> 00:16:10,465
She saw through my disguise
and knew I was a woman.

291
00:16:11,305 --> 00:16:12,825
Could she have guessed my purpose?

292
00:16:13,825 --> 00:16:15,345
It matters little
if we have alerted them.

293
00:16:15,825 --> 00:16:18,225
I doubt Ling Yunfei
will stop for now.

294
00:16:18,945 --> 00:16:20,745
Although Lady Situ helped us this time,

295
00:16:21,345 --> 00:16:22,305
you must remain cautious

296
00:16:22,745 --> 00:16:24,185
when dealing with her.

297
00:16:24,265 --> 00:16:25,505
The human heart is unpredictable.
We must stay on guard.

298
00:16:27,225 --> 00:16:29,705
Your Majesty seems quite close
to Situ Xue,

299
00:16:29,785 --> 00:16:31,265
yet you dislike seeing me near her.

300
00:16:31,745 --> 00:16:33,025
Judging by your expression,

301
00:16:34,345 --> 00:16:35,785
could you be jealous?

302
00:16:38,385 --> 00:16:40,465
You flatter yourself,
Young Master He.

303
00:16:40,545 --> 00:16:42,625
I would never stoop
to compete for anyone's favor.

304
00:17:01,785 --> 00:17:02,625
Sir.

305
00:17:03,145 --> 00:17:04,825
I followed your instructions

306
00:17:04,905 --> 00:17:07,145
and revealed Ling Yunfei's movements
to her.

307
00:17:07,225 --> 00:17:08,625
But will this

308
00:17:08,705 --> 00:17:11,065
affect our grand plan
for the Infinity Pills?

309
00:17:11,705 --> 00:17:12,545
It will not.

310
00:17:12,945 --> 00:17:15,225
If Ling Yunfei were so easily captured,

311
00:17:15,305 --> 00:17:17,225
he would not have remained free so long.

312
00:17:17,305 --> 00:17:18,945
Even if you had told her nothing,

313
00:17:19,025 --> 00:17:20,505
she would have investigated to the end.

314
00:17:20,585 --> 00:17:22,145
We might as well use this

315
00:17:22,225 --> 00:17:23,545
to earn a measure of her trust.

316
00:17:23,625 --> 00:17:24,585
But

317
00:17:25,185 --> 00:17:26,625
what if Meng Tinghui succeeds?

318
00:17:26,705 --> 00:17:27,945
All the better.

319
00:17:28,025 --> 00:17:30,785
Then everything will belong
to the Blood Moon Society.

320
00:17:31,745 --> 00:17:34,265
We have established the Tomb of the Poisoned
in Wangxian Valley.

321
00:17:34,345 --> 00:17:36,385
yet Ling Yunfei harbors ambitions

322
00:17:36,465 --> 00:17:38,945
and covets the foundations
of the Blood Moon Society.

323
00:17:39,025 --> 00:17:41,425
He clearly wants all the profits
from the Infinity Pills for himself.

324
00:17:42,145 --> 00:17:43,985
Unfortunately, he chose
the wrong opponent.

325
00:17:45,825 --> 00:17:48,385
Buying weapons this time
has exhausted all the pill profits.

326
00:17:48,465 --> 00:17:50,305
This enterprise belonged to you
from the beginning.

327
00:17:50,385 --> 00:17:52,105
How dare Ling Yunfei interfere?

328
00:17:52,185 --> 00:17:53,745
Since he has treacherous intentions,

329
00:17:54,545 --> 00:17:56,785
we will use Meng Tinghui

330
00:17:56,865 --> 00:17:58,145
to eliminate him for us.

331
00:17:58,985 --> 00:17:59,865
Exactly.

332
00:18:00,305 --> 00:18:02,585
The more chaotic this game becomes,
the better.

333
00:18:03,905 --> 00:18:05,665
Continue drawing Meng Tinghui closer.

334
00:18:05,745 --> 00:18:07,185
When the time comes,

335
00:18:07,945 --> 00:18:09,945
add more fuel to the fire.

336
00:18:13,945 --> 00:18:16,225
Sir, your hand is still bleeding.

337
00:18:16,905 --> 00:18:17,945
It is only a minor wound.

338
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:21,145
Ten years…

339
00:18:21,465 --> 00:18:22,905
On every full-moon night,

340
00:18:22,985 --> 00:18:24,785
you use your own blood

341
00:18:24,865 --> 00:18:26,225
to honor the Zhongwan royal family.

342
00:18:26,305 --> 00:18:27,705
The blade of the Blood Moon Society

343
00:18:27,785 --> 00:18:29,545
must not be dulled by a minor wound.

344
00:18:30,385 --> 00:18:31,745
Otherwise, those departed souls

345
00:18:31,825 --> 00:18:33,145
may blame me
for failing to protect you.

346
00:18:34,145 --> 00:18:35,225
This blood

347
00:18:35,785 --> 00:18:38,385
is not wasted if offered
to Zhongwan's dead.

348
00:18:39,625 --> 00:18:40,905
However,

349
00:18:43,665 --> 00:18:46,225
you overstepped today.

350
00:18:47,065 --> 00:18:48,065
I merely

351
00:18:49,145 --> 00:18:50,465
could not bear to see you hurt.

352
00:18:51,025 --> 00:18:51,985
A physician

353
00:18:52,865 --> 00:18:54,305
will tend to my hand.

354
00:18:55,225 --> 00:18:56,625
I worried needlessly.

355
00:18:59,065 --> 00:19:00,185
Remember your place.

356
00:19:01,105 --> 00:19:02,105
All of you, leave.

357
00:19:36,425 --> 00:19:37,265
Chief.

358
00:19:39,945 --> 00:19:40,785
Come, Lü Da.

359
00:19:40,865 --> 00:19:41,745
Sit and eat with us.

360
00:19:43,265 --> 00:19:44,145
Thank you, Chief.

361
00:19:48,145 --> 00:19:49,065
Sister Ruyan is here.

362
00:19:57,425 --> 00:19:58,465
What is it?

363
00:19:58,545 --> 00:19:59,505
Did you miss me?

364
00:20:00,305 --> 00:20:01,185
Could you not wait for me
to visit you?

365
00:20:01,985 --> 00:20:03,585
Enough. Stop teasing.

366
00:20:04,625 --> 00:20:06,585
Meng Tinghui came
to Wanxiang House today.

367
00:20:07,425 --> 00:20:08,705
Throughout the conversation,

368
00:20:08,785 --> 00:20:10,025
she kept asking

369
00:20:10,105 --> 00:20:11,065
about the Infinity Pills.

370
00:20:15,625 --> 00:20:16,865
If we are to do business,

371
00:20:16,945 --> 00:20:18,505
we must build a network
throughout Daning.

372
00:20:19,865 --> 00:20:21,025
She would learn of it sooner or later.

373
00:20:22,465 --> 00:20:23,425
We are wagering

374
00:20:24,385 --> 00:20:25,425
that she cannot catch us.

375
00:20:26,665 --> 00:20:27,545
But

376
00:20:28,585 --> 00:20:30,345
the court's wanted notice

377
00:20:30,425 --> 00:20:31,545
has been posted for half a month.

378
00:20:32,305 --> 00:20:34,305
Your elder brother still does nothing.

379
00:20:34,985 --> 00:20:36,505
He is a hypocrite.

380
00:20:37,025 --> 00:20:38,785
He sent men to violate Meng Tinghui,

381
00:20:39,265 --> 00:20:40,425
then framed you for it.

382
00:20:41,065 --> 00:20:42,185
His heart is far darker than ours.

383
00:20:42,825 --> 00:20:44,425
Back when our gambling houses

384
00:20:44,505 --> 00:20:45,705
were bringing in a fortune each day,

385
00:20:46,025 --> 00:20:47,425
you followed his orders

386
00:20:47,505 --> 00:20:48,465
and procured female students

387
00:20:48,545 --> 00:20:50,625
to win officials over
and clear his path.

388
00:20:50,705 --> 00:20:53,505
Now the court has banned gambling,

389
00:20:53,585 --> 00:20:54,545
and our business is gone.

390
00:20:55,185 --> 00:20:56,625
Yet he still will not help us.

391
00:20:56,705 --> 00:20:58,705
In the past, we labored
only for another's gain.

392
00:21:01,385 --> 00:21:02,785
But these Infinity Pills

393
00:21:04,065 --> 00:21:06,065
are now our own true business.

394
00:21:08,705 --> 00:21:09,865
Why is it called

395
00:21:09,945 --> 00:21:11,545
the Tiger's Roar Gang?

396
00:21:13,385 --> 00:21:15,545
Because I want all Daning

397
00:21:16,665 --> 00:21:18,145
to hear my voice.

398
00:21:18,625 --> 00:21:21,065
If Meng Tinghui dares block my path,

399
00:21:21,905 --> 00:21:24,305
I will let her taste
this newly made poison.

400
00:21:28,145 --> 00:21:29,705
Focus on making money first.

401
00:21:32,625 --> 00:21:33,505
Do not worry.

402
00:21:34,105 --> 00:21:35,185
The Infinity Pills

403
00:21:35,265 --> 00:21:36,865
are in great demand
at Wanxiang House.

404
00:21:38,105 --> 00:21:39,225
In only a few days,

405
00:21:39,705 --> 00:21:40,945
we have earned ten thousand taels.

406
00:21:41,025 --> 00:21:42,345
Whatever you wish to do,

407
00:21:44,025 --> 00:21:45,265
I will stand by you.

408
00:21:47,665 --> 00:21:48,505
Come.

409
00:21:51,825 --> 00:21:52,865
Stop at once.

410
00:21:57,665 --> 00:22:00,185
Is this not the virtuous Chancellor
who mastered the floods?

411
00:22:01,145 --> 00:22:02,385
What a rare guest.

412
00:22:03,545 --> 00:22:04,705
Your distinguished presence

413
00:22:05,305 --> 00:22:07,425
brings great honor
to the Tiger's Roar Gang.

414
00:22:08,025 --> 00:22:10,265
Outsiders should not be present.

415
00:22:11,985 --> 00:22:13,345
She is the woman I love most.

416
00:22:14,305 --> 00:22:16,345
He is my sworn brother
who has risked his life with me.

417
00:22:16,425 --> 00:22:18,705
You may speak freely before them.

418
00:22:20,905 --> 00:22:22,865
You trust any disreputable person.

419
00:22:23,545 --> 00:22:24,905
You truly have no standards.

420
00:22:29,225 --> 00:22:30,345
If I cannot trust them,

421
00:22:31,225 --> 00:22:34,345
should I trust my sanctimonious,
utterly hypocritical brother?

422
00:22:36,945 --> 00:22:39,665
You always hide in the shadows
like a coward.

423
00:22:47,185 --> 00:22:48,785
You do not even dare show your face.

424
00:22:53,225 --> 00:22:54,945
Stop selling those poison pills at once.

425
00:22:55,425 --> 00:22:57,065
Leave the capital within three days.

426
00:22:57,145 --> 00:22:59,185
Why? Our gambling houses were closed.

427
00:22:59,425 --> 00:23:01,305
We finally found a new source of income,

428
00:23:01,385 --> 00:23:02,745
and you expect us to stop
because you say so?

429
00:23:02,825 --> 00:23:04,745
Are you afraid
we will not share the profits?

430
00:23:05,345 --> 00:23:06,465
Do not worry.

431
00:23:06,545 --> 00:23:07,825
You will receive

432
00:23:08,585 --> 00:23:09,745
your share of the profits.

433
00:23:09,825 --> 00:23:11,385
I told you long ago:

434
00:23:11,465 --> 00:23:12,665
you may touch any business,

435
00:23:12,745 --> 00:23:13,865
but never poison.

436
00:23:15,385 --> 00:23:16,785
Seek wealth without taking lives.

437
00:23:16,865 --> 00:23:18,505
That is the only path to longevity.

438
00:23:19,345 --> 00:23:20,225
Listen to that.

439
00:23:21,465 --> 00:23:23,145
My elder brother is so righteous.

440
00:23:23,745 --> 00:23:25,185
All the dirty, arduous work

441
00:23:25,985 --> 00:23:27,625
was done by my hands for you,

442
00:23:28,945 --> 00:23:30,625
-including killing…
-Silence!

443
00:23:31,105 --> 00:23:33,465
Meng Tinghui's blade
is nearly at your throat.

444
00:23:33,545 --> 00:23:34,825
Do you still not know
you are courting death?

445
00:23:35,665 --> 00:23:37,545
My lord Chancellor is so formidable.

446
00:23:37,625 --> 00:23:39,945
Then why not dispose
of Meng Tinghui for Yunfei?

447
00:23:41,025 --> 00:23:41,945
All these years,

448
00:23:42,625 --> 00:23:44,345
how many times has he been your blade?

449
00:23:44,425 --> 00:23:45,985
A mere whore

450
00:23:46,665 --> 00:23:48,225
dares question this Chancellor?

451
00:23:52,465 --> 00:23:53,985
Would you like to taste

452
00:23:55,585 --> 00:23:57,585
this ecstasy, Brother?

453
00:23:57,665 --> 00:23:59,145
You are mad.

454
00:23:59,225 --> 00:24:00,065
Yes.

455
00:24:00,145 --> 00:24:01,265
I am mad.

456
00:24:01,345 --> 00:24:03,065
From the day you had me
abduct Yuan Lingyi

457
00:24:03,145 --> 00:24:04,385
so you could play the hero,

458
00:24:04,465 --> 00:24:06,065
then turned around
and sent me to prison,

459
00:24:06,825 --> 00:24:07,825
I was already mad.

460
00:24:07,905 --> 00:24:10,025
I soon freed you
and gave you a new identity.

461
00:24:10,105 --> 00:24:11,665
Am I supposed to thank you?

462
00:24:13,585 --> 00:24:14,465
In this life,

463
00:24:16,545 --> 00:24:18,185
I have thanked you
for only one thing.

464
00:24:26,745 --> 00:24:28,025
You little bastard!

465
00:24:28,105 --> 00:24:30,465
You think you can survive
on our turf?

466
00:24:30,545 --> 00:24:32,105
I am not a bastard!

467
00:24:32,185 --> 00:24:34,065
I have parents,
and I have an elder brother!

468
00:24:34,145 --> 00:24:35,185
Beat him!

469
00:24:41,905 --> 00:24:43,145
With me here,

470
00:24:43,225 --> 00:24:44,145
who dares bully my little brother?

471
00:24:50,745 --> 00:24:52,545
Yunfei, are you all right?

472
00:24:55,265 --> 00:24:56,105
I am your brother.

473
00:24:59,505 --> 00:25:00,545
Brother.

474
00:25:01,385 --> 00:25:02,985
Whenever anyone bullies you,

475
00:25:03,065 --> 00:25:04,265
come find me.

476
00:25:05,145 --> 00:25:06,145
I will protect you.

477
00:25:06,945 --> 00:25:08,305
He has always remembered
the word "brother."

478
00:25:08,825 --> 00:25:10,065
But what about you?

479
00:25:10,625 --> 00:25:11,745
You use him every time,

480
00:25:13,025 --> 00:25:14,865
turning family affection
into a bargaining chip.

481
00:25:15,705 --> 00:25:16,625
You make him willingly

482
00:25:16,705 --> 00:25:17,545
serve as your blade

483
00:25:17,625 --> 00:25:18,705
and your stepping stone.

484
00:25:19,185 --> 00:25:20,385
You have calculated

485
00:25:20,825 --> 00:25:22,385
this bargain very shrewdly.

486
00:25:23,105 --> 00:25:24,425
It is because you are my own brother

487
00:25:24,505 --> 00:25:25,985
that I will never let you touch poison.

488
00:25:26,065 --> 00:25:27,585
All these years,

489
00:25:27,665 --> 00:25:29,665
we have worked flawlessly together
in every other business.

490
00:25:29,745 --> 00:25:30,625
Why insist on this?

491
00:25:32,625 --> 00:25:33,745
You poisonous woman.

492
00:25:34,225 --> 00:25:36,625
If you truly care for him,
persuade him to stop.

493
00:25:38,825 --> 00:25:39,945
Yunfei.

494
00:25:40,385 --> 00:25:41,785
Listen to your brother.

495
00:25:41,865 --> 00:25:43,105
Lie low until the danger passes.

496
00:25:50,025 --> 00:25:51,465
I cannot escape.

497
00:25:51,545 --> 00:25:53,065
Neither can you.

498
00:25:53,145 --> 00:25:54,625
Lü Da, see our guest out.

499
00:25:54,705 --> 00:25:55,945
Yes, Chief.

500
00:25:59,305 --> 00:26:00,145
Lord Chancellor.

501
00:26:00,985 --> 00:26:01,865
This way, please.

502
00:26:05,305 --> 00:26:06,425
Please.

503
00:26:28,065 --> 00:26:29,385
Mistress Situ said

504
00:26:29,465 --> 00:26:30,305
that before sunset,

505
00:26:30,385 --> 00:26:32,105
she would send word
to Bofeng Tavern.

506
00:26:32,185 --> 00:26:33,545
It is already so late.

507
00:26:33,625 --> 00:26:35,025
Why is there still no news?

508
00:26:35,105 --> 00:26:36,105
It is here.

509
00:26:36,545 --> 00:26:37,865
My lord.

510
00:26:37,945 --> 00:26:38,945
The message has arrived.

511
00:26:44,345 --> 00:26:45,945
According to Xiangning,

512
00:26:46,025 --> 00:26:47,945
the next batch of Infinity Pills
will reach the capital in a month.

513
00:26:48,025 --> 00:26:50,465
As Ling Yunfei's lover,

514
00:26:50,545 --> 00:26:52,025
Liu Ruyan handles
the poison-pill trade for him.

515
00:26:52,105 --> 00:26:53,345
She must know a great deal.

516
00:26:53,425 --> 00:26:54,825
They are meeting in secret today.

517
00:26:54,985 --> 00:26:56,985
We must seize this chance
to capture Ling Yunfei

518
00:26:57,065 --> 00:26:58,305
and intercept the poison pills.

519
00:26:58,385 --> 00:26:59,705
-Yes.
-Zhili.

520
00:27:00,185 --> 00:27:02,385
Report to His Majesty at once.
We will split up.

521
00:27:42,305 --> 00:27:43,545
Please stop, my lords.

522
00:27:43,625 --> 00:27:44,945
This is the madam's private chamber.

523
00:27:45,025 --> 00:27:45,865
You may not enter.

524
00:27:46,705 --> 00:27:48,105
The Office of Public Inquiry
is handling a case.

525
00:27:48,185 --> 00:27:49,065
All others, stand aside.

526
00:27:49,625 --> 00:27:50,505
You are…

527
00:27:50,585 --> 00:27:51,905
the gentleman from that day.

528
00:27:51,985 --> 00:27:53,905
-The madam is bathing.
-If you obstruct us again,

529
00:27:53,985 --> 00:27:55,305
you will be punished
for hindering official business.

530
00:27:57,745 --> 00:27:58,585
Light Cavalry, heed my command.

531
00:27:58,665 --> 00:28:00,385
No one is to approach.

532
00:28:00,465 --> 00:28:01,305
-Yes.
-Yes.

533
00:28:08,545 --> 00:28:09,385
Madam Liu.

534
00:28:11,345 --> 00:28:12,225
My lord.

535
00:28:12,305 --> 00:28:13,905
Perhaps Lieutenant Di and I
should first…

536
00:28:35,625 --> 00:28:36,465
Yinqing.

537
00:28:42,625 --> 00:28:43,465
My lord.

538
00:28:43,545 --> 00:28:44,945
It would be improper for me to enter.

539
00:28:47,425 --> 00:28:48,505
My lord.

540
00:28:48,585 --> 00:28:49,585
This…

541
00:28:59,345 --> 00:29:00,185
Lord Meng.

542
00:29:02,185 --> 00:29:03,385
She is dead.

543
00:29:05,265 --> 00:29:06,505
Madam!

544
00:29:11,465 --> 00:29:12,305
Impossible.

545
00:29:13,065 --> 00:29:15,505
She was just speaking to us.

546
00:29:16,665 --> 00:29:17,505
How could this happen?

547
00:29:25,025 --> 00:29:25,865
Who…

548
00:29:26,905 --> 00:29:28,745
Who killed you?

549
00:29:31,345 --> 00:29:32,425
My lord.

550
00:29:32,505 --> 00:29:34,665
Could Ling Yunfei have killed her
to silence her?

551
00:29:43,545 --> 00:29:44,505
Do not jump to conclusions.

552
00:29:45,625 --> 00:29:46,785
The blood has not dried.

553
00:29:48,425 --> 00:29:49,985
The killer may not have gone far.

554
00:29:52,665 --> 00:29:53,865
Lord Meng.

555
00:29:55,145 --> 00:29:57,225
Please avenge the madam.

556
00:29:58,625 --> 00:30:00,065
If you want justice for her,

557
00:30:01,385 --> 00:30:03,185
tell me everything you know.

558
00:30:03,265 --> 00:30:05,145
The Infinity Pills. Ling Yunfei.

559
00:30:05,225 --> 00:30:06,945
-Do not leave out a word.
-Tell her!

560
00:30:07,025 --> 00:30:08,825
Do you want the real killer
to remain free?

561
00:30:09,465 --> 00:30:10,345
Lord Meng.

562
00:30:11,785 --> 00:30:14,145
Wanxiang House appears
to belong to Madam Liu,

563
00:30:14,225 --> 00:30:17,305
but it is really Ling Yunfei's
source of illicit wealth.

564
00:30:17,385 --> 00:30:18,985
Have you ever seen
Ling Yunfei's true face?

565
00:30:20,665 --> 00:30:23,025
I only occasionally heard

566
00:30:23,905 --> 00:30:25,265
a man and woman
inside the madam's room.

567
00:30:25,345 --> 00:30:26,865
But strangely,

568
00:30:26,945 --> 00:30:29,705
no one ever saw how Ling Yunfei
entered or left Wanxiang House.

569
00:30:29,785 --> 00:30:30,865
As for the Infinity Pills,

570
00:30:31,105 --> 00:30:33,145
we truly do not know
where they came from.

571
00:30:33,225 --> 00:30:34,265
My lord.

572
00:30:34,985 --> 00:30:37,425
Please obtain justice for the madam.

573
00:30:38,225 --> 00:30:41,025
She cannot die
without the truth being known.

574
00:30:47,345 --> 00:30:49,705
Liu Ruyan was suspected
of colluding with the Tiger's Roar Gang

575
00:30:49,785 --> 00:30:50,745
to sell Infinity Pills,

576
00:30:51,385 --> 00:30:52,225
and now she has died mysteriously.

577
00:30:53,865 --> 00:30:54,705
Commandant Di.

578
00:30:55,105 --> 00:30:56,545
Seal Wanxiang House at once.

579
00:30:56,625 --> 00:30:58,305
Keep everyone here
under temporary guard.

580
00:30:58,385 --> 00:31:00,225
You are involved in this case

581
00:31:00,305 --> 00:31:01,545
and are also an important witness.

582
00:31:01,625 --> 00:31:04,185
Come with me to another room
and await questioning.

583
00:31:10,225 --> 00:31:11,465
My lord.

584
00:31:11,945 --> 00:31:13,225
What should we do now?

585
00:31:15,545 --> 00:31:17,065
Since this was their secret meeting place,

586
00:31:17,625 --> 00:31:19,345
there must be clues.

587
00:31:19,425 --> 00:31:20,865
Search carefully.

588
00:31:20,945 --> 00:31:22,945
Take every item back
to the Office of Public Inquiry.

589
00:31:23,025 --> 00:31:24,105
Guards.

590
00:31:36,785 --> 00:31:37,625
My lord.

591
00:31:52,865 --> 00:31:53,825
My lord.

592
00:31:54,505 --> 00:31:55,785
A mere courtesan

593
00:31:55,865 --> 00:31:57,385
had so much gold, silver, and jewelry.

594
00:31:58,225 --> 00:32:00,185
It seems every highly profitable trade

595
00:32:00,265 --> 00:32:01,505
is forbidden by Daning law.

596
00:32:01,585 --> 00:32:02,545
Come here.

597
00:32:07,505 --> 00:32:09,265
This is not the work
of a renowned painter,

598
00:32:09,345 --> 00:32:10,585
and the technique is mediocre.

599
00:32:11,985 --> 00:32:13,585
Could it hide some secret?

600
00:32:14,065 --> 00:32:15,385
Is there anything else?

601
00:32:15,465 --> 00:32:17,025
Only this gold, silver, and jewelry.

602
00:32:17,105 --> 00:32:18,265
Take it all back
to the Office of Public Inquiry.

603
00:32:18,345 --> 00:32:19,385
Yes.

604
00:32:20,585 --> 00:32:21,945
Now that Liu Ruyan is dead,

605
00:32:22,625 --> 00:32:24,825
the clues we hoped
to obtain from her

606
00:32:25,905 --> 00:32:27,145
have been completely severed.

607
00:32:34,345 --> 00:32:37,185
Your Majesty, Lord Meng found no trace
of Ling Yunfei at Wanxiang House.

608
00:32:37,265 --> 00:32:39,185
Ling Yunfei is cunning and suspicious.

609
00:32:39,265 --> 00:32:40,265
That was to be expected.

610
00:32:40,945 --> 00:32:42,305
But once he appears,

611
00:32:43,025 --> 00:32:44,545
we will see everything from here.

612
00:32:53,745 --> 00:32:54,865
Liu Ruyan is dead.

613
00:32:56,465 --> 00:32:58,025
She ran Wanxiang House for years.

614
00:32:58,745 --> 00:33:00,785
She must have made you
many promises.

615
00:33:00,865 --> 00:33:03,225
Enter my house as sisters.

616
00:33:03,745 --> 00:33:06,585
Leave it as women of standing.

617
00:33:07,865 --> 00:33:10,225
The madam gave us
a place to call home.

618
00:33:10,305 --> 00:33:11,225
She…

619
00:33:12,785 --> 00:33:14,585
showed us boundless kindness.

620
00:33:16,505 --> 00:33:18,185
She mistook her charms for a blade,

621
00:33:18,265 --> 00:33:20,105
not knowing that blade

622
00:33:20,185 --> 00:33:22,105
would ultimately turn
against the one who wielded it.

623
00:33:22,745 --> 00:33:24,185
Her death today

624
00:33:24,265 --> 00:33:25,305
was the price.

625
00:33:25,385 --> 00:33:26,225
We…

626
00:33:28,265 --> 00:33:30,225
We only wanted a way to survive.

627
00:33:30,985 --> 00:33:33,305
A livelihood must be earned
with your own hands.

628
00:33:34,505 --> 00:33:35,745
Should you wish to begin again,

629
00:33:35,825 --> 00:33:38,985
apothecaries, teahouses,
and embroidery shops

630
00:33:39,065 --> 00:33:40,305
can all take apprentices.

631
00:33:40,385 --> 00:33:42,105
Living by your own hands

632
00:33:42,185 --> 00:33:43,865
is better than depending on others.

633
00:33:43,945 --> 00:33:46,265
Those willing to start anew,
register at once.

634
00:33:46,345 --> 00:33:47,505
Once the case is resolved,

635
00:33:47,585 --> 00:33:49,625
the Office of Public Inquiry
will arrange places for you.

636
00:33:52,065 --> 00:33:52,985
Should we go?

637
00:33:58,425 --> 00:33:59,665
My lord has shown us great kindness.

638
00:33:59,745 --> 00:34:00,705
I am willing to try.

639
00:34:02,825 --> 00:34:03,945
So am I.

640
00:34:04,025 --> 00:34:08,145
-We are willing to try too.
-We are willing to try too.

641
00:34:08,745 --> 00:34:09,985
Wanxiang House

642
00:34:10,865 --> 00:34:11,905
is hereby sealed

643
00:34:13,185 --> 00:34:14,545
and will never reopen.

644
00:34:27,105 --> 00:34:28,145
The prey has appeared.

645
00:35:28,105 --> 00:35:28,945
Your Majesty.

646
00:35:29,025 --> 00:35:29,945
These people are behaving strangely.

647
00:35:30,025 --> 00:35:31,705
They seem to have lost their minds
and fallen under someone's control.

648
00:35:46,945 --> 00:35:47,945
Your Majesty.

649
00:35:48,305 --> 00:35:49,665
We have confirmed this man's identity.

650
00:35:50,265 --> 00:35:52,385
He is a resident of the capital
who vanished half a month ago.

651
00:35:53,425 --> 00:35:54,345
It is not only them.

652
00:35:54,945 --> 00:35:56,585
The Household Relief Office
conducted a full census

653
00:35:57,825 --> 00:35:59,025
and discovered that over the past year,

654
00:35:59,105 --> 00:36:00,145
in the outskirts of the capital,

655
00:36:00,225 --> 00:36:01,665
villagers have gone missing
one after another.

656
00:36:01,745 --> 00:36:03,065
Continue investigating

657
00:36:03,145 --> 00:36:04,185
these people in particular.

658
00:36:04,265 --> 00:36:07,265
And what did you find
on Liu Ruyan's side?

659
00:36:07,345 --> 00:36:09,345
Only some gold, silver, and jewelry.

660
00:36:09,425 --> 00:36:10,865
Nothing unusual has been found yet.

661
00:36:10,945 --> 00:36:12,185
It seems our breakthrough

662
00:36:12,945 --> 00:36:14,345
lies with these people.

663
00:36:18,465 --> 00:36:19,545
This villager…

664
00:36:37,385 --> 00:36:38,465
This poison is unusual.

665
00:36:39,025 --> 00:36:40,665
-Summon the coroner at once.
-Yes.

666
00:36:46,425 --> 00:36:47,465
Meng Tinghui.

667
00:36:48,745 --> 00:36:50,785
How dare you kill Ruyan?

668
00:36:50,865 --> 00:36:52,865
I will never let you go.

669
00:36:54,625 --> 00:36:55,465
Chief.

670
00:36:57,345 --> 00:36:58,425
Ruyan.

671
00:36:58,505 --> 00:36:59,465
Chief.

672
00:36:59,745 --> 00:37:01,145
You should lead the brothers

673
00:37:01,225 --> 00:37:02,905
to avenge Sister Ruyan,

674
00:37:02,985 --> 00:37:04,225
not stay here like this.

675
00:37:05,065 --> 00:37:06,625
Were Sister Ruyan still alive,

676
00:37:07,985 --> 00:37:09,945
she would not want you
to hurt yourself.

677
00:37:10,025 --> 00:37:10,985
Get out of my way.

678
00:37:11,825 --> 00:37:12,665
Do not think

679
00:37:12,745 --> 00:37:14,385
I would never strike a brother.

680
00:37:14,465 --> 00:37:15,705
If beating me

681
00:37:16,305 --> 00:37:17,945
would make you feel better,

682
00:37:19,385 --> 00:37:20,945
I would accept it without regret.

683
00:37:32,945 --> 00:37:34,105
Get out.

684
00:37:34,185 --> 00:37:36,145
All of you, get out!

685
00:37:36,225 --> 00:37:37,185
Get out!

686
00:38:59,625 --> 00:39:00,585
Yunfei.

687
00:39:11,505 --> 00:39:12,385
Yunfei.

688
00:39:22,065 --> 00:39:22,905
Ruyan.

689
00:39:24,865 --> 00:39:25,745
Ruyan.

690
00:39:30,505 --> 00:39:32,505
Ruyan.

